[en.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER]
New Business Partner

[en.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_desc]
“We have no eternal allies, and we have no perpetual enemies. Our interests are eternal and perpetual, and those interests it is our duty to follow.” — Ponymerston, Appleloosa political commentator

[en.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_TOOLTIP]
We will begin looking for new business partners in Ponyville, and we do not rule out the possibility of interfering in the Ponyville election.

[zh.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER]
新合作伙伴

[zh.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_desc]
“我们没有永恒的盟友，也没有永恒的敌人。我们的利益是永恒和永久的，我们的责任是追随这些利益。” — 驹麦斯顿，苹果鲁萨政治评论家

[zh.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_TOOLTIP]
我们将开始在小马谷寻找新的合作伙伴，不排除干预小马谷大选的可能性。

